# L §8.5 WARN-UNREAD (tally 2.1.2, issue #30): each place here is named once, and none warns. lokata only by deps's
# binding over its kind; konto2 only by pay_to's row, the value p's leg books into; karta only by an observed row's leg;
# unexplained only by a pad; world by p's leg. spare is the one unread item, so the warnings are compared.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
source bk "bank"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind deposits: place PLN min 0
input bank: observed
input amt: money PLN
input day: date
input pay_to: key accounts
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place lokata: deposits lives 2026-01-01..
place konto2: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place karta: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
place unexplained: outside lives 1900-01-01..

def spare: int = 1
def deps[d in days]: money PLN = sum(bal(x, d) for x in deposits on d)

move p: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to pay_to amount amt

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31), deps[2026-03-31]

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  amt = 10.00 PLN
  day = 2026-02-10
  pay_to = konto2
  opening[konto] = 5.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[lokata] = 7.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[konto2] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start
  opening[karta] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

version st
  cite bk
  governs 2026-02
  known 2026-03-02
  covers konto
  pad konto from unexplained
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-02-05, kind: transfers, leg cash from world to karta amount 3.00 PLN) "r1"
=== expect
q: (5.00 PLN, 7.00 PLN)
  cut 2026-06-30
warning: WARN-UNREAD def spare is read by nothing
